                "text": "I'm trying to figure out the shape with 5 points - it looks like a projectile trail shooting leftward, with the pattern of filled and blank cells in that row suggesting a dashed line extending from the origin point toward the left edge.\n\nThe 7-shape seems to be pointing downward instead, with its trail extending down the column to the bottom edge - the wall it hits gets fully painted in that color, and where a 5-trail and 7-trail would overlap at a corner, it seems to become 0.\n\nSo both trails follow the same alternating pattern: painted cell, gap, painted cell, gap, until hitting the wall which gets fully colored. I want to test this theory against another example to confirm.",
